OL,3,GNEWSAComplaints about animal sales at
OL,4,ABridgwater Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the oldest town fairs in the
OL,7,Fcountry is being investigated following
OL,8,Fclaims vendors were selling dogs, cats
OL,9,Fand poultry without a licence and in
OL,10,Fpoor condition.
OL,12,FBridgwater Town Council, along with the
OL,13,FRSPCA and Somerset Council, said it was
OL,14,F"aware of concerns" surrounding the
OL,15,Fsale and welfare of animals at
OL,16,FBridgwater Fair.
OL,18,FThe opening day of the fair - an
OL,19,Fimportant event in the traveller
OL,20,Fcommunity - traditionally sees the sale
OL,21,Fof horses.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
