OL,3,GNEWSAComplaints about animal sales at
OL,4,ABridgwater Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said complaints around the
OL,7,Fsale and welfare of other animals at
OL,8,Fthis year's fair has been
OL,9,F"unprecedented".
